0.000000                 k1_hat      ! Constant in the expression of Cc due to leading edge vortex effects.  [ignored if UA_Mod<>1]
Default                  x_cp_bar    ! Constant in the expression of \hat(x)_cp^v. [ignored if UA_Mod<>1, default = 0.2]
Default                  UACutout    ! Angle of attack above which unsteady aerodynamics are disabled (deg). [Specifying the string "Default" sets UACutout to 45 degrees]
